If a clinician ensures an affordable-follow-up-evaluation-access for a patient then the clinician can minimize an unintended-patient-effect.
If a clinical-practice-organization ensures an affordable-follow-up-evaluation-access for a patient then the clinical-practice-organization can minimize an unintended-patient-effect.
If a health-system ensures an affordable-follow-up-evaluation-access for a patient then the health-system can minimize an unintended-patient-effect.
